ears, especially in the Navy.

209
00:12:52,300 --> 00:12:54,594
We have to keep our eyes on the target.

210
00:12:54,700 --> 00:12:55,600
You know that.

211
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,400
Of course I do.

212
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:01,600
But this incident hit me hard.

213
00:13:02,540 --> 00:13:04,460
Those scholars were harmless.

214
00:13:04,820 --> 00:13:08,720
All they did was ask questions in
the face of an unreasonable law.

215
00:13:09,040 --> 00:13:11,280
And the government burned them for it.

216
00:13:13,900 --> 00:13:16,860
I'll just have to start a fire of my own.

217
00:13:17,620 --> 00:13:20,260
I always thought you despised Vaughan.

218
00:13:20,780 --> 00:13:22,640
This broken world must change.

219
00:13:22,900 --> 00:13:24,800
And I'll be the one to do it.

220
00:13:25,380 --> 00:13:27,220
In memory of Clover.

221
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:31,060
For all of Ohara, I will press on.

222
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,500
Later that year,

223
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,647
Dragon bolstered his forces,

224
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:42,040
recruiting Empire Ivankov
and Bartholomew Kuma.

225
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:45,800
They formed the Revolutionary Army,

226
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:49,260
and they've shaken the world ever since.

227
00:13:52,900 --> 00:13:54,680
I can totally see why.

228
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:55,900
He sounds awesome.

229
00:13:56,100 --> 00:13:57,057
Back up for a second.

230
00:13:57,140 --> 00:13:58,937
You said those giants came from Elbath?

231
00:13:59,020 --> 00:14:01,517
The Think Dragon and
Professor Clover were friends.

232
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,080
And I never had a clue.

233
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:04,510
Evil, huh?

234
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:08,456
So he joined up with Luffy's
dad right from the start?

235
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,176
I feel like my brain's gonna explode.

236
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:12,757
None of this makes sense.

237
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:14,899
Why did Kuma help us two years ago?

238
00:14:15,900 --> 00:14:17,617
